WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Hours help you remember how much time you spent.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Stories help you remember why the experience mattered.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Start with one specific moment. Describe what happened, what you noticed, and what changed in your thinking.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
That small reflection becomes evidence you can use in advising conversations, applications, and future decisions.
